  "body": [
    "Fairtrade Canada's 2025 Annual Report is now live. Read about our activities, sales, and Premium generated last year.",
    "When you choose Fairtrade, you back the world’s most trusted label. You choose fairer prices, safer work, climate care and progress on child labour.",
    "C$2.45 billion Fairtrade Premium earned by farmers and workers over a decade",
    "~2M farmers and workers in over 70 countries",
    "+37,000 products sold with the Fairtrade MARK in more than 140 countries",
    "We believe trade should benefit everyone in the supply chain. Fairtrade offers solutions for companies and producers to put fairness at the heart of what they do.",
    "+1.5 b Fairtrade Premium earned in the past decade",
    "56 externally funded projects active in 2023",
    "Want to know what impact choosing Fairtrade really has? We track our progress through various methods to measure the impact of our work.",
    "Do you want to know the basics? Do you want to know the basics? Our what is Fairtrade section covers what we do and why we do it. You can watch a short video about us, learn how many Fairtrade organisations are there, and what areas are critical to our work. What is Fairtrade",
    "Do you want to dive deep into how Fairtrade works? Do you want to dive deep into how Fairtrade works? Our how we work section covers the Fairtrade standards that are available, our different types of labels and a detailed list of our projects and programmes across the world. Read more",
    "Do you want to become Fairtrade certified? Do you want to become Fairtrade certified? Our For Business section gives you a summary of the reasons why to get certified and all the steps you must follow. Read more",
    "Do you want to discover Canadian Fairtrade brands? Do you want to discover Canadian Fairtrade brands? If you’re looking to shop your values, discover some of these amazing Canadian brands who are committed to people and planet. Discover more"
  ],
